<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>uses<sp/>DMA<sp/>channel<sp/>to<sp/>transfer<sp/>data<sp/>from<sp/>a<sp/>buffer<sp/>to<sp/>another<sp/>buffer<sp/>in<sp/>RAM.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>example<sp/>does<sp/>the<sp/>below</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Configures<sp/>DMA<sp/>channel<sp/>to<sp/>transfer<sp/>data<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>source<sp/>address<sp/>to<sp/>destination<sp/>address<sp/>specified.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>The<sp/>example<sp/>triggers<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>channel<sp/>repeatedly<sp/>until<sp/>the<sp/>transfer<sp/>of<sp/>16<sp/>bursts<sp/>(where<sp/>each<sp/>burst<sp/>is<sp/>8<sp/>16-bit<sp/>words)<sp/>has<sp/>been<sp/>completed.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>When<sp/>the<sp/>whole<sp/>transfer<sp/>is<sp/>complete<sp/>it<sp/>triggers<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>interrupt.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>All<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>configuratins<sp/>are<sp/>done<sp/>in<sp/>SysConfig</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Watch<sp/><sp/>Variables</highlight></codeline>
